    "summary": "Address each split unit from its wired controller, pick BACnet/IP or MS/TP, set a unique device instance from the LCD menu, then map each unit's object block using the instance formula. On/off, mode, fan and setpoint are writable value objects; room temperature and failure status are read-only.",
